  hint: Found near the shops
  characterDescription: 'Cat

    Found near the shops

    Outfit inspired by
    the medieval era

    Celeste is a very fashionable cat, and can frequently
    be found eyeing outfits in shop windows. She wants to be a fashion designer,
    and uses her friends'' wardrobes to practice. Milly especially will come to Celeste
    if she is stuck on what to wear. Celeste  also made a lot of the costumes her
    friends are wearing to the party.

'
